<p>Whenever a creature is killed by yourself or a minion you feast on its essence, gaining <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 15, 20, 23, 27</acronym> mana.</p><p>At level 3 the thrill of the death invigorates you, granting a movement speed bonus of 50% for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>